      "text": "Stir in the {ketchup}, the {worcestershire}, the {brown-sugar}, the {mustard}[tomato-paste: , the {tomato-paste}] and the {water}. Season with {salt} and {black-pepper} and simmer, stirring now and then, until thick enough to hold on a spoon. Check against a trusted guide to doneness.",
